    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d931">

                <pb facs="1087" n="1007" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1007"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Eddy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-10-04"><hi rendition="#italic">October 4,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee states that if Miss Stone is held in Turkey, Mr. Eddy is to bring to
                    the attention of the Turkish Government the facts in relation to the abduction
                    and the very great importance the United States Government attaches to her safe
                    deliverance from the brigands; to request the aid of the Turkish Government and
                    impress upon it the extreme gravity of the affair.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
